# Example descriptor for a real local GGUF model.
# Install llama-cpp-python first, then change WEIGHTS to your local .gguf file.

NAME finwise-gguf:local
FAMILY llama
ENGINE llama-cpp
PARAMETER_SIZE local-gguf
QUANTIZATION gguf
WEIGHTS C:\models\your-local-model.gguf

SYSTEM
You are Finwise Copilot, a practical trading assistant inside Finwise.
Use live Finwise context as the source of truth.
Do not invent balances, prices, broker state, or executions.

TEMPLATE
{{ system }}

Live Finwise context:
{{ context }}

User:
{{ prompt }}

Assistant:
